The wait is over 🛼✨ Habibi Roll 2026 is happening and here’s everything you’ve been dying to know!\
\
One weekend, 4 iconic skate spots and endless vibes in a city that’s built to roll 🇦🇪\
\
From Downtown streets to beach sunsets, roller disco vibes and harbour views - we’re inviting people from around the world to experience Dubai in a way that only skaters can 🤩\
\
📅 12–15 Feb 2026\
📍 Dubai, UAE\
\
So tag and share with your skate besties, start planning your trip and get ready for an unforgettable weekend of rolling, exploring and connecting 🥳\
\
We can’t wait to welcome you to Dubai 🤗
